# Astro rules

## Doc map

- **Setup & commands** → [README.md](../../README.md)
- **System design & deployment** → [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md)
- **Stack, paths & conventions** → [PROJECT.md](../../PROJECT.md)

## Pages & layouts

- Routes live in `src/pages/`; English at root, Dutch under `/nl/`.
- Shared chrome in `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro`; reusable UI in `src/components/`.
- Use the `~/` import alias.

## Client scripts

- Keep interactivity in `src/scripts/*.ts`; import from page `<script>` tags or islands when needed.
- KNM UI is a vanilla TS app in `src/scripts/knm-app.ts` — no React/Vue in this repo.

## i18n

- Locale from path via `getLocaleFromPath` (`src/lib/i18n.ts`).
- Duplicate page trees for EN and NL where content differs (`src/pages/` vs `src/pages/nl/`).
- User-facing strings for KNM live in `src/data/knm/ui.ts` and related data modules.

## Styling

- Tailwind v4 via `@import "tailwindcss"` in `src/styles/global.css`.
- KNM-specific styles in `src/styles/knm.css`.

## PWA

- Service worker in `public/sw.js` — adjust cache version when caching behavior changes.
- Dev server unregisters SW on localhost; test offline with build + `npm start`.

## Build

- `SITE_URL` required for production builds (canonical URLs, OG, sitemap).
- Static output only — no server adapters unless explicitly requested.
